<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ Treasurer to hold 5.00 pm news conference.</title>
<headline>NZ Treasurer to hold 5.00 pm news conference.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Treasurer Winston Peters said on Thursday he would hold a news conference at 5.00 p.m. (0400 GMT) on Treasury's post-election briefing paper released an hour earier.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
